    "summary": "Duct flute made of bamboo. Five front finger holes placed at the bottom of the tube, single rectangular hole near top. Stopper is missing from angled top of flute. Two bands of carved decoration at base of flute and directly below rectangular hole. Bands of incised geometric decoration, mainly triangles, diamonds and zigzags applied down length of flute; star designs incised around finger holes. Decoration possibly applied using hot implement to create blackened effect.",
